Package: hd-screensavers
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: hd-desktop, libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers, @PROGRAM_DEPENDS@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: HyprDebian screensavers
 Optional screensavers of the HyprDebian desktop, drawn with Vulkan on
 every monitor, against the burn-in of OLED monitors. Each covers every
 monitor with a scene of its own, and ends on a key, a move of the mouse, a
 click, a scroll or a touch.
 .
 hd-pipes draws the 3D pipes of Windows NT, after pipes.c of xscreensaver
 by Marcelo F. Vianna.
 .
 hd-logo is the moving logo of the old DVD players: the Debian swirl with
 HyprDebian over it, bouncing on black in the colours of the theme, light
 on the GPU and the battery.
 .
 mesa-vulkan-drivers makes sure there is a Vulkan device: RADV, ANV, or
 lavapipe, which renders on the CPU.
